<title>USA: MBIA qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Eden Prairie School District No 272, Minn., $7.07 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Laredo, Texas, $3.66 million combined purpose, $2.86 million combined purpose and $5.83 million GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
